      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">صَقَرُ</span></b>  a name of <i>Hell;</i> a dial. var. of <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">سَقَرُ</span> [q. v.].
(K.) ＝   
    <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer1"> </span>-A2-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">صَقَرٌ</span> <i>Fallen leaves of the</i> [<i>kind of trees
called</i>] <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عِضَاه</span>, and [particularly] <i>of the</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عُرْفُط</span>, (M,
